Depends: ${misc:Depends}, i3-wm, i3status, rofi, feh, dunst, rxvt-unicode, lightdm, lightdm-gtk-greeter
Description: ALX-i3 desktop configuration, LightDM defaults, and dark theme
 Provides the default i3 window manager, i3status bar, rofi, dunst, GTK dark
 theme, and urxvt configurations under /etc/skel, along with LightDM session
 defaults, an original geometric dark wallpaper, and the Super+? keybinding
 cheat-sheet for Algothix OS (ALX) Lite.
